  <name>iris</name>
  <summary>Screenshot and screen-recording utility</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      iris is a native, lightweight screen capture and screen recording utility
      built with GPUI. It features a background daemon with tray controls,
      global hotkeys, and an IPC listener, paired with region capture,
      window capture, screen recording via PipeWire, and an annotation editor.
    </p>
  </description>
